rast medium</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a3;131.3 (&#x000a3;120.0&#x02013;&#x000a3;135.4)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a3;65.6<sup>e</sup></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Overheads/capital charges</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a3;45.8 (&#x000a3;34.9&#x02013;&#x000a3;61.8)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a3;45.8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Total cost</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a3;405.1 (&#x000a3;320.9&#x02013;&#x000a3;506.2)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a3;249.6</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote2"><label>a</label><p>Reducing time for taking scan by 36&#x00025; (30&#x02009;min instead of 47&#x02009;min) with the same staff configuration.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote3"><label>b</label><p>Reducing time for analysing scan by 50&#x00025; (15&#x02009;min instead of 30&#x02009;min) with the same staff configuration.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote4"><label>c</label><p>10&#x02009;h running time and 30&#x02009;min examination time.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote5"><label>d</label><p>Equipment costs were discounted at 3.5&#x00025; (assuming 10 years life span).</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote6"><label>e</label><p>Cost of contrast medium reduced by 50&#x00025; (generic formulation and/or lower dose (0.1&#x02009;mmol&#x02009;kg<sup>&#x02212;1</sup> body weight)); CE-MRI, contrast enhanced magnetic resonance imaging.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Number of recalls in study and analysis</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/